Recommended Retry Policy 

Initial retry after 5 seconds, then exponential backoff (10, 20, 40, 80 seconds) with a maximum of 5 attempts. 

Do Not Retry Conditions 

Do not retry NoRetry responses including validation, authentication, authorisation and business rule errors. 

Correlation ID Handling 

Always log CorrelationId and provide it when raising support tickets. 

Bulk Processing Guidance 

For partial failures, remediate and resubmit only failed items rather than the entire batch.
 
 

